        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, burned in boiler condensing modulating 50kW (proj. 388)</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, burned in boiler condensing modulating 50kW (proj. 388)
Inventory for 1 MJ natural gas, burned in a gas boiler condensing modulating with a capacity of 50 kW for a multi- family house with 2100 operating hours;
UUID: 6bbaec18-1eda-32d2-9e75-88a4e47d78a5
The module includes fuel input from (CH) network, infrastructure (boiler), emissions to air and water, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Data apply to the combustion in Switzerland.
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6bbaec18-1eda-32d2-9e75-88a4e47d78a5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
